  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In a Southern Border dream realm, legendary immemorial desolate beast Zuo Ye Hui, trapped by a four elements formation after eating enough, roars and bursts out a powerful dark grey light that envelops the entire valley. Two beastman Gu Immortals name it the immortal killer move grey night and try to retreat; the four elements formation resists and limits the grey light to the valley, but the light eliminates grass, rocks, and Fang Yuan within it.",
      "chapters": [
        1337
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_zuo_ye_hui",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside the giant dream realm, Zuo Ye Hui opens its mouth and shoots a huge dark grey beam of light that dyes and rips at a Southern Border super Gu formation layer; righteous path Gu Immortals name it Zuo Ye Hui’s signature immortal killer move Grey Night. An earlier grey night cast with Hei Lou Lan, Bai Ning Bing, and Fairy Miao Yin had destroyed the fourth layer. Fang Yuan notes the real-world form differs from the dream realm version and must have been modified. Ba De states Zuo Ye Hui has already used grey night twice, that this is the limit, and that it needs to rest; Fang Yuan sees it panting and unmoving from exhaustion after those casts.",
      "chapters": [
        1350
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "signature-beam",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_super_gu_formation",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "char_ba_de"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan notes that no matter how many times grey night was modified, the core remains grey night.",
      "chapters": [
        1356
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unchanged-core",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan reinforces the formation’s second layer under a four elements concept that includes dark path Immortal Gu, grey night as a dark grey beam contests the super Gu formation like spear and shield, and the formation side wins and blocks the attack.",
      "chapters": [
        1356
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-contest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Later, Zuo Ye Hui opens its mouth and lets out grey night against Heaven Overseeing Tower; Fate Vanquish answers, grey night vanishes in the white light, and Zuo Ye Hui is pushed away with broken bones and tendons.",
      "chapters": [
        1366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fate-vanquish-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "move_fate_vanquish"
      ]
    }
